@startuml
!include _style.puml
title Run lifecycle (RunStatus)
[*] --> clarifying : create
clarifying --> clarifying : answer (more questions)
clarifying --> planning : all answered / skip
planning --> planning : edit or revise plan\n(revision + 1)
planning --> running : lock
running --> awaiting_review : draft at the human gate
running --> failed : error (resumable)
failed --> running : resume from last checkpoint
awaiting_review --> completed : approved, overridden\nor sent back
completed --> [*]
@enduml
